{"id":"75a4c54baaa666ef","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-display-correspondence.md","title":"满理解与 display maps","display":"thm-display-correspondence — 满理解与 display maps","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-thm-display-correspondence","aliases":["16-thm-display-correspondence","Display/type correspondence","16-display-correspondence"],"display":"thm-display-correspondence — 满理解与 display maps","depends_on":["[[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]","[[16-df-full-comprehension]]","[[16-df-display-map]]","[[16-df-display-fibration]]"],"source":"§10.4, full comprehension presentations, pp. 613–615 (PDF 633–635); explicit consequence","revision_date":"2026-10-19"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-display-correspondence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-display-correspondence</span><span>Display/type correspondence</span><span>16-display-correspondence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-display-correspondence — 满理解与 display maps"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"25140205ca0312de\" href=\"?note=25140205ca0312de\" title=\"16-df-natural-transformation-definition\">16-df-natural-transformation-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dfea0d23e394e93b\" href=\"?note=dfea0d23e394e93b\" title=\"16-df-full-comprehension\">16-df-full-comprehension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"274c21b30aac62ac\" href=\"?note=274c21b30aac62ac\" title=\"16-df-display-map\">16-df-display-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"53dadf7eff1efeea\" href=\"?note=53dadf7eff1efeea\" title=\"16-df-display-fibration\">16-df-display-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§10.4, full comprehension presentations, pp. 613–615 (PDF 633–635); explicit consequence"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FullComp}(p,\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{FullComp}(p,\\chi)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)\">\\(D=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)\\)</span> 是理解投影的垂直同构闭包。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf D\">\\(\\mathbf D\\)</span>、满包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_D\">\\(\\iota_D\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"53dadf7eff1efeea\" href=\"?note=53dadf7eff1efeea\" title=\"16-df-display-fibration\">16-df-display-fibration</a> 的带源靶标签交换方块构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar\\chi\">\\(\\bar\\chi\\)</span> 由下节给出的对象/箭头映射定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathcal C\\simeq\\mathcal D\">\\(F:\\mathcal C\\simeq\\mathcal D\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"25140205ca0312de\" href=\"?note=25140205ca0312de\" title=\"16-df-natural-transformation-definition\">16-df-natural-transformation-definition</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivFunctor}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivFunctor}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\)</span>；这包含实际准逆与两个自然同构的存在。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bar\\chi_0(X)\\coloneqq\\chi X,\\qquad\\bar\\chi_1(f)\\coloneqq\\chi f,\\qquad\\bar\\chi\\coloneqq\\langle\\bar\\chi_0,\\bar\\chi_1\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bar\\chi_0(X)\\coloneqq\\chi X,\\qquad\\bar\\chi_1(f)\\coloneqq\\chi f,\\qquad\\bar\\chi\\coloneqq\\langle\\bar\\chi_0,\\bar\\chi_1\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bar\\chi:\\mathcal E\\simeq\\mathbf D,\n\\qquad\\operatorname{cod}_D\\bar\\chi=p,\\qquad\\iota_D\\bar\\chi=\\chi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bar\\chi:\\mathcal E\\simeq\\mathbf D,\n\\qquad\\operatorname{cod}_D\\bar\\chi=p,\\qquad\\iota_D\\bar\\chi=\\chi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>证明：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span> 的像位于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>，故有因子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar\\chi\">\\(\\bar\\chi\\)</span>。因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf D\">\\(\\mathbf D\\)</span> 是箭头范畴的满子范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span> 的满忠实性逐 Hom 传递给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar\\chi\">\\(\\bar\\chi\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:A\\to I\">\\(d:A\\to I\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 时存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal E_I\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal E_I\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\cong_I\\chi X\">\\(d\\cong_I\\chi X\\)</span>；故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar\\chi\">\\(\\bar\\chi\\)</span> 本质满，得到位于基范畴上的等价。</li>\n<li>无须假定严格索引类型函子；对一般理解范畴缺少满忠实性时，此等价不成立。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，§10.4, full comprehension presentations, pp. 613–615 (PDF 633–635); explicit consequence。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-natural-transformation-definition","status":"resolved","id":"25140205ca0312de","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-full-comprehension","status":"resolved","id":"dfea0d23e394e93b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-full-comprehension]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-display-map","status":"resolved","id":"274c21b30aac62ac","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-display-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-display-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"53dadf7eff1efeea","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-display-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-display-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"53dadf7eff1efeea","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf D$、满包含 $\\iota_D$ 采用 [[16-df-display-fibration]] 的带源靶标签交换方块构造；$\\bar\\chi$ 由下节给出的对象/箭头映射定义。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-natural-transformation-definition","status":"resolved","id":"25140205ca0312de","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F:\\mathcal C\\simeq\\mathcal D$ 采用 [[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]] 的 $\\mathrm{EquivFunctor}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)$；这包含实际准逆与两个自然同构的存在。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FullComp}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf D","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_D","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"F:\\mathcal C\\simeq\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EquivFunctor}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar\\chi_0(X)\\coloneqq\\chi X,\\qquad\\bar\\chi_1(f)\\coloneqq\\chi f,\\qquad\\bar\\chi\\coloneqq\\langle\\bar\\chi_0,\\bar\\chi_1\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\bar\\chi:\\mathcal E\\simeq\\mathbf D,\n\\qquad\\operatorname{cod}_D\\bar\\chi=p,\\qquad\\iota_D\\bar\\chi=\\chi.","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf D","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"d:A\\to I","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"d\\cong_I\\chi X","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar\\chi","display":false}],"bytes":1968,"backlinks":[{"id":"2ac3d596368e32ad","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"反向取理解投影的垂直同构闭包；在满理解假设下，总范畴与相应 display-map 范畴等价，见 [[16-thm-display-correspondence]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-412","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-display-correspondence|thm-display-correspondence — 满理解与 display maps]]"},{"id":"5b8f5b92f1d4cb67","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FullComp}(p,\\chi)$；$D=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)$，$\\mathbf D$ 的态射是全部交换方块；定义及证明见 [[16-thm-display-correspondence]]。"}],"outgoing":["25140205ca0312de","dfea0d23e394e93b","274c21b30aac62ac","53dadf7eff1efeea"]}